<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal drains funds at 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal drains funds at 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it drained 175.9 billion escudos from the money market at a fixed rate of 5.7 percent.</p>
<p>The offer was held under the old terms. The drain, or absorption rate, was cut to 5.4 percent on Friday with effect from Monday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
